This program is a modified version of Arc Launcher
(https://github.com/meddouribadis/arclauncher), itself based on LTvLauncher
and FLauncher. All original copyright notices are kept in the source files.

Changes from Arc Launcher, made from October 2026 on, include: new name,
icon, banner and application id (com.jryolsn.tazama), app lock, dim screen,
quick panel, VPN guard, "Replace current launcher", sideload build and
release workflow, TV setup scripts and the "Nebula" visual style. The full list is in the git history.

The phone camera view downloads the scrcpy server (https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy,
Apache License 2.0) at build time and bundles it, and uses dadb
(https://github.com/mobile-dev-inc/dadb, Apache License 2.0).

